00:01:10.299 --> 00:01:13.463
Guys guys guys welcome to how we made your mother.
伙计们，欢迎来到《我们是如何老妈的》。

00:01:13.463 --> 00:01:17.891
I'm Josh Radroom here with my friend Craig Thomas Josh guys guys guys.
我是乔什·拉德鲁姆，和我的朋友克雷格·托马斯在一起，乔什，伙计们。

00:01:17.891 --> 00:01:19.410
It's like a catchphrase.
