And Dave and Chuck are always just, you know, hot, top hat.
而戴夫和查克总是那样，你知道的，高顶礼帽。

00:15:59.879 --> 00:16:03.240
I'll give you what you have, I will, I will do the assignment.
你想要什么我就给你什么，我会把这个任务完成。

