Pitch until until we, I get you to laugh or we get a green light and I'm not going to question in the direction.
不断提创意，直到把你们逗笑或者方案通过为止，而且我绝不会质疑方向。

00:16:11.332 --> 00:16:18.297
And I would say going from how much mother to shows where I'm in charge of the like, oh, we're going this way.
我要说的是，从《老爸老妈浪漫史》这种我说了算的剧组——哦，我们要往这边走，我们要往那边走。

00:16:18.297 --> 00:16:19.627
We're going that way.
我们要往那边走。

00:16:19.627 --> 00:16:22.730
I much prefer going back in my chairs going here.
我其实更喜欢回到我原来的座位上，然后说：来吧。

00:16:22.730 --> 00:16:23.363
Ten ideas.
十个点子。

00:16:23.363 --> 00:16:24.566
Take what you want.
挑你们想要的。

