Yeah.
对。

00:16:43.960 --> 00:16:45.759
I didn't understand what you guys were up to.
我以前根本不懂你们在搞什么。

00:16:45.759 --> 00:16:54.519
And I just wanted Chuck Tatham's and Dave Hemingsons to be pitching me stuff and that be questioning things and then bumping on stuff.
我只是希望查克·塔瑟姆和戴夫·海明森能向我提出各种点子，然后互相质疑，再碰撞出火花。

00:16:54.519 --> 00:16:55.039
Funny.
真有意思。

00:16:55.039 --> 00:16:57.600
But yeah, you carmically had to become a showrunner.
不过说真的，从因果报应的角度讲，你终究得成为一名运作人（showrunner）。

